-### ACM-F002: Organizations List Route Bypasses Org Access
-
-**Severity:** Low
-**Evidence:** `GET /api/v1/organizations` lists ALL orgs with only `requireAuth`.
-**Recommendation:** Apply `requireAdmin` or scope to user's memberships.
