-### ACM-F007: `requireOrgAccess` Admin Bypass
-
-**Severity:** Informational
-**Evidence:** Admin in Org A can access Org B data through any `requireOrgAccess` endpoint.
-**Recommendation:** Document this behavior explicitly.
