-
-### MTI-002: Cross-Tenant User Data Access via Users API (P1 ΓÇö Confirmed)
-
-**Attack Scenario:** User of Org-A reads full profile + memberships of a user in Org-B.
-
-**Path:**
-1. `GET /api/v1/users/<org-b-user-uuid>` ΓÇö `requireAuth` only ΓåÆ enters handler
-2. Handler uses `getSupabaseAdmin()` ΓåÆ bypasses RLS entirely
-3. No org scope check ΓåÆ returns any user's data
-
-**Evidence:**
-- `users.ts:11`: No `requireOrgAccess`
-- `users.ts:160-176`: `GET /:id` ΓÇö uses `getSupabaseAdmin()`, no admin check
-- `users.ts:178-255`: `GET /:id/detail` ΓÇö returns profile + memberships + orgs + roles
-
-**Simulated Request:**
-```
-GET /api/v1/users/a1b2c3d4-... (User from Org-B)
-Authorization: Bearer <org-a-user-token>
-```
-
-**Result:** `{ id, full_name, email, phone, title, is_super_admin, ... }` ΓÇö FULL PROFILE RETURNED
-
-**Escalated Attack:**
-```
-GET /api/v1/users/a1b2c3d4-.../detail
-Authorization: Bearer <org-a-user-token>
-```
-
-**Result:** `{ user, profile, memberships: [...], organizations: [...], roles: [...] }` ΓÇö ALL MEMBERSHIPS AND ORGS OF TARGET USER
-
-**Ultra Escalated Attack:**
-```
-GET /api/v1/users/a1b2c3d4-.../permissions
-Authorization: Bearer <org-a-user-token>
-```
-
-**Result:** `{ memberships, permissions, rolePermissionIds, overrides }` ΓÇö FULL PERMISSION MATRIX OF TARGET USER
-
-**Impact:** **Critical cross-tenant data exposure.** Any authenticated user (even unapproved members) can read the complete profile, memberships across ALL orgs, roles, and permission overrides of any user in the system.
-
