-Step 2: GET /api/v1/roles/<super_admin_id>/permissions ΓåÆ Map all permissions
-Step 3: Look for membership creation/role assignment endpoint without proper checks
-  ΓåÆ PATCH /api/v1/memberships/:id has requireAdmin (blocks)
-  ΓåÆ memberships.ts:123-155 has requireAdmin (blocks)
-Step 4: If role assignment is found, elevate to super_admin
