-## Defense Layers Assessment
-
-| Layer | Strength | Gaps |
-|---|---|---|
-| API Middleware (`requireOrgAccess`) | Γ£à Strong ΓÇö applied to 37/44 route files | Γ¥î 7 route files lack it |
-| API Middleware (`requireAdmin`) | Γ£à Strong ΓÇö applied correctly | ΓÇö |
-| RLS Functions (`is_org_member`) | Γ£à Correct ΓÇö checks approved membership | Γ¥î Only effective with user-JWT queries |
-| `getSupabaseAdmin()` vs `getSupabaseUser()` | ΓÜá∩╕Å All routes except profiles use admin | Γ¥î RLS is bypassed on 43/44 route files |
-| JWT Session Tokens | Γ£à HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax | Γ¥î No org claims in JWT payload |
-| Rate Limiting | Γ£à Global + user + auth | Γ¥î No per-account lockout |
