-| Component | Status | Gap |
-|---|---|---|
-| retry_count column | Γ£à Present | Not incremented by dispatcher |
-| next_retry_at column | Γ£à Present | Never set by dispatcher |
-| dead_letter boolean | Γ£à Present | Never set to true |
-| webhook_dead_letters table | Γ£à Present | Never populated |
-| Retry worker | Γ¥î Absent | No BullMQ consumer |
-| Exponential backoff | Γ¥î Absent | No schedule defined |
-
