-### Recovery
-
-| Step | Automated? | Manual fallback | Evidence |
-| ---- | ---------- | --------------- | -------- |
-| Rate limit expires | Γ£à (external API recovers) | ΓÇö | ΓÇö |
-| Next task succeeds | Γ£à | ΓÇö | Worker continues |
