-### Gaps
-
-| Gap | Severity | Evidence | Mitigation |
-| --- | -------- | -------- | ---------- |
-| No worker task retry (RES-P2-003) | P2 | `consumer-bullmq.ts` no retry | Add BullMQ retry + backoff |
