-### Missing Policies (Resolved by 5302101)
-- Γ£à profiles DELETE (not applicable ΓÇö profiles soft-linked to auth.users)
-- Γ£à documents DELETE
-- Γ£à tickets DELETE
-- Γ£à projects DELETE
-- Γ£à file_requests DELETE
-- Γ£à ticket_comments DELETE ΓÇö added with `auth.uid() = created_by` check
-
-### Outstanding Gaps
-- Γ¥î No storage bucket RLS for `documents` DELETE at policy level (API handles via signed URLs + service role)
-- Γ¥î No bulk-operation RLS check (handled at middleware level, not RLS)
-- Γ¥î No SEEDATA/DATA cleanup policy for admin operations
