-### Item: Request Lifecycle (API)
-
-```mermaid
-flowchart LR
-    A[Incoming HTTP] --> B[express.json verify]
-    B --> C[request-id]
-    C --> D[security-headers]
-    D --> E[preflight CORS]
-    E --> F{auth required?}
-    F -->|Yes| G[requireAuth]
-    F -->|No| H[optionalAuth]
