-
-- **Evidence**: `apps/api/src/main.ts` lines 1-120 (middleware mounting order), all 16 middleware files
-- **What it does**: 7-layer middleware pipeline:
-  1. `express.json({ verify })` ΓÇö captures raw body for webhook signature verification
-  2. `request-id` ΓÇö X-Request-ID header + structured logging correlation
-  3. `security-headers` ΓÇö nonce-based CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options
-  4. `preflight handling` ΓÇö CORS with per-environment origins
-  5. `auth` ΓÇö JWT verify (local fast path ΓåÆ Supabase fallback)
-  6. `rate-limit` ΓÇö configurable per-endpoint (300/15min global, stricter on auth)
-  7. `org-access` ΓÇö tenant isolation (membership check)
-  8. `Route handler` ΓåÆ `error middleware` (catches all thrown/next(err))
-- **Dependencies**: express, jsonwebtoken, zod, pino, express-rate-limit, cookie-parser, cors
-- **Current controls**: Nonce-based CSP (generated per-request), rate limiting per route group, Zod validation on all mutations, X-Request-ID correlation, request timeout (60s default)
-- **Missing controls**: None identified
-- **Risks**: Low
-- **Recommended improvement**: None
