-Key strengths: (1) Comprehensive coverage ΓÇö every API route has a corresponding SDK method, (2) Admin UI is extensive ΓÇö 140+ admin pages across all modules, (3) Portal provides client self-service for 105+ pages, (4) 74 database migrations with audit trails, (5) Audit logging on all mutation endpoints, (6) Permission-based access control.
