-Notable gaps: (1) 35 SDK modules with `.api.ts` variants suggest partial auto-generation or dual-path modules (explicit checks needed), (2) Worker tasks exist for only ~10 of 60+ modules ΓÇö most modules have no async processing, (3) ~20 modules have `.api.ts` parallel SDK files suggesting WIP generation, (4) Storefront module exists only as prompt-pack patch files ΓÇö not yet deployed.
