-- Evidence: Widespread use of `text-slate-400` (#94a3b8) and `text-slate-500` (#64748b) on `bg-[#0A1118]` (#0A1118) background ΓÇö found in 100+ locations across all route groups
-- What it does: Low-contrast text for descriptions, muted information, placeholders
