-**Critical issue: AGENTS.md test counts are 9 months stale.** The banner claims "774 tests all green (182 API + 108 SDK + 24 Worker + 460 Web)" ΓÇö these numbers date from June 2026 and predate the massive module expansion. Actual counts: ~584 API, ~247 SDK, ~31 Worker, ~397 Web, ~56 E2E specs. The later "1,530 tests" claim is also stale. This misleads every AI agent reading the context file.
