-- Severity: P2
-- Confidence: Medium
-- Area: Container runtime / build
-- Evidence:
-  - `apps/api/Dockerfile:23-28`, `apps/worker/Dockerfile:23-28` ΓÇö runtime stage `pnpm install --prod`
-  - `apps/api/Dockerfile:5-8`, `apps/worker/Dockerfile:5-8` ΓÇö only `apps/<app>` + root manifests copied; `packages/` is **not** copied
-  - `apps/api/package.json:17` / `apps/worker/package.json:18` declare `@mct/config` (workspace) as a dependency, but no runtime source imports it (report 11 SC-P3-001)
