-### Finding ID: SEC-P2-001 - Jira/JSM webhook dedup keys are not event-unique ΓÇö legitimate deliveries suppressed for 24h
-
-- Severity: P2
-- Confidence: High
-- Area: Webhook delivery / data integrity
-- Evidence:
-  - `apps/api/src/routes/webhooks.ts:246` ΓÇö `jiraKey = \`jira-${event.webhookEvent ?? "unknown"}-${issueKey ?? "unknown"}\``
-  - `apps/api/src/routes/webhooks.ts:324` ΓÇö `jsmKey` same shape
-  - `apps/api/src/lib/idempotency.ts:49` ΓÇö `IDEMPOTENCY_TTL_SECONDS = 24 * 60 * 60`
-  - `apps/api/src/routes/webhooks.ts:96` ΓÇö Stripe uses `stripe-${event.id}` (event-unique, correct); `:427-432` ΓÇö M365 uses a payload digest (correct)
