-- What is happening: Functions default to EXECUTE granted to PUBLIC. Any caller (including `anon` through PostgREST) can execute the function against **any** `knowledge_articles` row in **any** org, incrementing any integer column (`helpful_count`, `not_helpful_count`, or arbitrary columns) as the function owner ΓÇö RLS is bypassed (definer) and the counter tamper crosses tenant boundaries.
