-- Missing controls / risks:
-  - `admin_ip_ranges` default `["0.0.0.0/0", "::/0"]` (variables.tf:79) and terraform-do's tfvars generator never sets it ΓåÆ SSH open to the internet on BOTH droplets (INFRA-P1-001).
-  - S3-compatible Spaces backend does not support state locking; terraform-do.yml has no concurrency group ΓåÆ concurrent applies can corrupt state (INFRA-P2-002).
-  - `ignore_changes = [user_data]` on the droplet ΓÇö cloud-init changes won't apply without manual re-provisioning (acceptable, but undocumented).
